From 35a205c48f551244e77b6cb0ebe59ffe4b46fd4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Huajin Wang <7976028+excelwang@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 23:22:23 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] net: airoha: add bounded opt-in PON RX metadata sampling

Port retained diagnostic interface without requiring the multicast or IFC implementations. AI assisted rebase; no new test runs.

Signed-off-by: Huajin Wang <7976028+excelwang@users.noreply.github.com>
---
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/Makefile          |   2 +-
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.c      |   6 +
 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_eth.h      |   3 +
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_pon_rx_diag.c  | 264 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_pon_rx_diag.h  |  24 ++
 5 files changed, 298 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_pon_rx_diag.c
 create mode 100644 drivers/net/ethernet/airoha/airoha_pon_rx_diag.h

